usage: hindsight-api [-h] [--host HOST] [--port PORT]
                     [--log-level {critical,error,warning,info,debug,trace}]
                     [--reload] [--workers WORKERS] [--access-log]
                     [--no-access-log] [--proxy-headers]
                     [--forwarded-allow-ips FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS]
                     [--ssl-keyfile SSL_KEYFILE] [--ssl-certfile SSL_CERTFILE]
                     [--daemon] [--idle-timeout IDLE_TIMEOUT]

Hindsight API Server

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --host HOST           Host to bind to (default: 0.0.0.0, env:
                        HINDSIGHT_API_HOST)
  --port PORT           Port to bind to (default: 8888, env:
                        HINDSIGHT_API_PORT)
  --log-level {critical,error,warning,info,debug,trace}
                        Log level (default: info, env:
                        HINDSIGHT_API_LOG_LEVEL)
  --reload              Enable auto-reload on code changes (development only)
  --workers WORKERS     Number of worker processes (env:
                        HINDSIGHT_API_WORKERS, default: 1)
  --access-log          Enable access log (env: HINDSIGHT_API_ACCESS_LOG,
                        default: False)
  --no-access-log       Disable access log (overrides env and default)
  --proxy-headers       Enable X-Forwarded-Proto, X-Forwarded-For headers
  --forwarded-allow-ips FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS
                        Comma separated list of IPs to trust with proxy
                        headers
  --ssl-keyfile SSL_KEYFILE
                        SSL key file
  --ssl-certfile SSL_CERTFILE
                        SSL certificate file
  --daemon              Run as background daemon (uses port 8888)
  --idle-timeout IDLE_TIMEOUT
                        Deprecated and ignored: the daemon no longer auto-
                        exits when idle (accepted for backward compatibility
                        with existing launchers).
